WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.522
The central ablation isolates where positional
information comes from.

00:00:04.602 --> 00:00:07.678
Starting from StyleGAN2 with non-constant input,

00:00:07.758 --> 00:00:10.242
the authors strip out all zero-padding,

00:00:10.322 --> 00:00:13.924
creating a padding-free variant with no positional cues.

00:00:14.004 --> 00:00:19.710
It fails to generate reasonable structure and
degrades sharply across every FID setting,

00:00:19.790 --> 00:00:24.575
confirming the original generator leaned entirely
on padding for position.

00:00:24.655 --> 00:00:26.876
Add the structure synthesizer back,

00:00:26.956 --> 00:00:31.939
and position is now supplied through the
coordinate-driven structural latent,

00:00:32.019 --> 00:00:34.700
so quality returns, validating the design.
